        "html": "<article style='height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:28px;border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#07111f,#0f4c5c,#4338ca);color:white;font-family:system-ui'><small style='letter-spacing:.18em;color:#cffafe'>QUESTION-DRIVEN EXPLANATION</small><h1 style='font:850 38px Georgia;margin:18px 0 10px'>What Is Twilite?</h1><p style='font-size:17px;color:#dbeafe'>A graph-native browser, authoring environment, and shared operating surface for people and AI.</p><div style='font-size:32px;margin-top:34px'>ideas → nodes → relationships → living systems</div></article>",
